flowchart LR
  %% A CI pipeline, straight from a README
  dev((Developer)) -->|git push| gh[GitHub]
  gh --> ci[CI runner]
  subgraph checks [Checks]
    lint[Lint] & test[Unit tests] & e2e[E2E tests]
  end
  ci --> lint & test & e2e
  lint & test & e2e --> gate{All green?}
  gate ==>|yes| reg[(Container registry)]
  gate -.->|no| slack[/Slack alert/]
  reg --> deploy[Deploy to staging]
